#  include/: https://github.com/Pramod645/UIOX/tree/main/02_FwHal/include
#
#  Design
#  ------
#  Pure portable C.  No assembly, no linker scripts, no _start, no main().
#  All types and APIs are self-contained inside include/ -- no external
#  SoC or platform headers are required.
#  Each ISA target produces one static library:
#
#    build/arm64/libuiox_fw_hal_arm64.a
#    build/arm32/libuiox_fw_hal_arm32.a
#    build/x86_64/libuiox_fw_hal_x86_64.a
#    build/riscv64/libuiox_fw_hal_riscv64.a
#
#  Targets : arm64 | arm32 | x86_64 | riscv64 | all | clean | help
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
